# libFuzzer's own output. `target/` is a build directory; `artifacts/` is where `cargo fuzz` writes a
# crashing input, and a crash does not stay there — it is minimised and committed as a named unit
# test in `crates/vitui-engine/src/fuzz.rs`, which is the whole point of §14's inversion.
#
# `corpus/` is deliberately **not** here. It is the gate.
/target
/artifacts
/coverage
